<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello {!Contact.FirstName},</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><b>You have been awarded the <a href="https://students.asu.edu/asu-college-attainment-grant-program">College Attainment Grant&nbsp;Program</a>&nbsp;at Arizona State University.</b> Our mission at ASU is to make college as affordable as possible. With this grant, there is no need for repayment and it will provide for your tuition and fees for up to four years.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Your Financial Aid Notification is posted in <a href="http://my.asu.edu/">My ASU</a> under your <b>Finances </b>tab. Your next step is to act on your awards. Please take advantage of our <a href="https://students.asu.edu/financialaid/budget">Student Budget Worksheet</a> to determine if you want to accept, modify or decline any part of your financial aid package.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Complete your Priority Tasks in <a href="http://my.asu.edu/">My ASU</a>:</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><ul><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">pay your <a href="https://students.asu.edu/freshman/deposit">enrollment deposit</a>*</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">confirm your <a href="https://housing.asu.edu/">housing preferences</a></span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">sign up for <a href="https://eoss.asu.edu/orientation">orientation</a></span></li><li>take the <a href="https://students.asu.edu/math">math placement test</a></li><li>submit your <a href="https://eoss.asu.edu/health/services/immunization">MMR immunization records</a></li></ul></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">*As a Federal Pell Grant recipient, you have the opportunity to <a href="https://asu.secure.force.com/kb/articles/FAQ/How-do-I-defer-my-enrollment-deposit/?q=enrollment&amp;l=en_US&amp;fs=Search&amp;pn=1">defer your enrollment deposit</a>.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">If you have any questions regarding your FAN, please feel free to contact me or <a href="https://students.asu.edu/contact/financialaid">Financial Aid and Scholarship Services</a>. I'd also be happy to discuss the costs and how to pay for your education.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>